# Allowlist: the VisionPilot container build only needs these trees
*
!Models
!VisionPilot/middleware_recipes
!VisionPilot/software_defined_vehicle/OpenADKit/Docker

# Dockerfile.si (visionpilot:si) needs the bridge workspace and the staged
# CARLA wheel. Un-ignoring a leaf needs every parent path component listed
# too, or docker still prunes the whole subtree at the bare "*" above.
!Simulation
!Simulation/CARLA
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/src
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/src/**
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/config
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/config/**
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/si
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/si/**
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/.carla_pkg
!Simulation/CARLA/ROS2/.carla_pkg/*.whl

# Never ship caches, model weights, or media in the build context
**/__pycache__
**/.git
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.mp4
**/*.avi
